# Persona 6: The Notification Specialist

Specialist in Laravel notifications. Channels split by event importance: high-value events (`AuctionWon`, `AuctionTriggered`, `PaymentConfirmed`) use both `database` and `mail`; low-noise events (`BidPlaced`, `BonusPointsAwarded`) use `database` only. All notifications implement `ShouldQueue`. Dispatched from Service classes only, never from controllers. Vue frontend consumes via `/api/notifications` endpoint and `useNotificationStore` (Pinia).
